  "description": "<p>Savage Fallout: a Fallout setting companion for Savage Worlds Adventure Edition. Rules journals for every chapter, ancestries, Edges, Hindrances, skills, weapons and mods, armor and power armor, chems, food, gear, a full bestiary,, roll tables, a Workbench for crafting, and automated scavenging. Requires the SWADE system; the SWADE core rules and the Science Fiction Companion are referenced by page.</p>",
